# finish/gem: T5-T6 gems on G (STYLE_P2 27.3; P2C_CONTRACTS 3b; LADDER-FINISH, ladder slice i3): a STAMP set laid once
# per G blob, keyed by its size (w, h capped at 3): 1x1 a pommel or a spear's socket, 2x1 / 1x2 a clasp, 2x2 a brow,
# 3x2 a chest or a boss, 3x3 a buckler's boss. A cut stone in two glow steps (B8: 3 glow steps a figure): the white
# point (1, Glow 4) at the top-left and the body (0, Glow 2); the piece owner's step-1 socket gives it its dark side.
# At T3-T4 G is the metal-2 boss (the resolver's recolour, no stamp). Absolute steps (a stamp). i3: the stone's shadow
# facet is the setting's dark gold (N, metal2 1); i2 named 'q' (skin 0) there by mistake.
use person
body adult
role overlay finish.gem
legend 0 glow 2
legend 1 glow 4
tags tile overlay stamp
on-region G

